### Create a reminder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "content": "Class scheduled",
  "dueAt": "2026-12-01T20:00:00+01:00"
}

### Create a reminder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "content": "Driving lessons",
  "dueAt": "2026-05-01T11:00:00+05:00"
}

### Error case: invalid date format (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Wrong Time",
  "dueAt": "2026-11-01T42:00:00+05:00"
}

### Get all reminders of the user (including already sent)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user
Accept: application/json

### Get reminders that still need a push notification
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders
Accept: application/json

### Same, but only those due before a given time
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders?dueBefore=2026-12-31T23:59:00%2B01:00
Accept: application/json

### Error case: invalid body (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "No due date"
}

### Error case: unknown id (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planner/reminders/user/does-not-exist